1327..1403 Comment "/// The presented integers as a model of the shape: `base` zero, a value, as"
1404..1481 Comment "/// the theory\'s `base : Pt` is a constant; `turn` the successor and `unturn`"
1482..1564 Comment "/// the predecessor. Each law is proved by `Path.here`: conversion reads the inner"
1565..1641 Comment "/// call under the constructor the outer one builds, and the integers\' rules"
1642..1662 Comment "/// cancel the pair."
